{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1002158-supernatural-thule","id":1002158,"title":"Supernatural Thule","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-12T01:50:59-08:00","id":1002158,"title":"Supernatural Thule","content":"Topic name is word play, as it is both about Thule variant with supernatural powers for <b>Hunter </b>AND Thule version from <i>Supernatural </i>TV show. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Let\u2019s start with the second \u2013 here is nice video clip explanation of group \u2013 see from 1:55.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ud0hOsvtrS8\" data-code=\"ud0hOsvtrS8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ud0hOsvtrS8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Thule in TV show are dark magicians bent on rising dead, that earlier started Nazi Party.<br /> <br /> And here is sum-up of what <a href=\"http://supernatural.wikia.com/wiki/Thules\" target=\"_blank\">Thule done in TV series</a> to this day.<br /> <br /> Now to<b> Hunter</b> part \u2013 from obvious reasons I wanted here to talk how to incorporate elements from SPN Thule into Loyalists of Thule in <b>Vigil</b>. \u2018Immortal necromancers\u2019 and their High Command sounds a lot like Three Men from Munich. In <b>CoD</b> universe, there is somehow connection to original Thule with Mysterium mages Order faction that wanted to destroy civilization, so some \u2018black magicians\u2019 teachings have a ground work ready to be spread. There are even Atlantean Kings in Loyalists dogma!<br /> <br /> <b>Greatest challenge is how to make Hunters Compact to possess sorcery</b>? Or maybe make proper Thule the witches ( from <b>Witch Finders</b> ) and Loyalists as subverted Hunters that hunt cursed black magicians of they forefathers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-12-2016, 10:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T05:06:45-08:00","id":1002188,"title":"","content":"It really depends on how restricted you feel magic is. I always felt the Loyalists have access to spells, hexes, and jinxes, since they have such a massive repository of ancient secrets. Plus there are the rules from Witch Finders on gutter magic, and I think there's a book with a section on hedge magic as well. But full blown sorcery, that feels a step too far, especially if they're going to be subverted in your plan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T06:13:19-08:00","id":1002194,"title":"","content":"I've made them a conspiracy-Endowment in<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32396-moving-up-in-the-tiers-compacts-into-conspiracies?p=40482#post40482\"> Going Up the Tiers</a> which is based around having a ghost-network based around the occult knowledge of Rmoahal ghosts. Their Verzauberung function may be helpful for you, considering it allows them to mimic the magic of monsters using the knowledge of the pre-human ghosts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T11:54:23-08:00","id":1002290,"title":"","content":"In my personal canon, many of the founding Loyalists were members of the Karotechia, the Ahnenerbe's overtly occult division from Delta Green, either overwhelmed by the guilt of aiding the Nazis with magic or acquired by the Americans after the war in a sort of supernatural PAPERCLIP op. Things get especially fun if the Karotechia is still kicking around, ancient Nazi bastards propping up a failing-but-volatile network of criminals, hate groups, and undead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T23:50:32-08:00","id":1002471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1002158-supernatural-thule#post1002158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are even Atlantean Kings in Loyalists dogma!</div> </div> </div> </div>I've mentioned this in other threads; in my canon, Thule is a misspelling, and while the Cthule Society never found Atlantis, they DID find ANOTHER sunken city full of lost, forbidden knowledge: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R%27lyeh\" target=\"_blank\">R'lyeh.</a><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Greatest challenge is how to make Hunters Compact to possess sorcery</b>? Or maybe make proper Thule the witches ( from <b>Witch Finders</b> ) and Loyalists as subverted Hunters that hunt cursed black magicians of they forefathers? </div> </div> </div>\u200bYou could pull some powers from &quot;The Cult of Things That Should Not Be&quot; section of <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/#prod-preview-picture-1-box\" target=\"_blank\">Second Sight</a>, and maybe some items from <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/50678/World-of-Darkness-Reliquary\" target=\"_blank\">Reliquary</a>.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T09:40:11-08:00","id":1004984,"title":"","content":"You could also just directly model it upon Benedictions, but instead of miracles and feast days, it is sorcery and stellar conjunctions. Depending on how much work you want to do, sometimes all you need is a new name and coat of paint. Boring, but it works.","signature":"<hr 